Z||000020||Patrick's Dad||11-18-2001||02:11 PM||||Terrific show up north, but bloody cold. My telescope frosted over (No, I didn't try to observe a meteor with it, but I did have two cameras!). A couple fireballs literally lit up the sky.<P>Saturn was spectacular last night as well. Can't wait to get that 4.8mm Nagler.||||reg||10
