Z||000026||JSocha||11-19-2001||09:45 AM||||Got home at about 2AM Sunday morning from Grand Forks.<P>Went downstairs to watch TV because at 3AM CDT not much was really going on in the sky and it was clear as a bell!<P>Headed out at 4:45AM to watch the celestial event...F&C*ing God *@!# clouds!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>Went to bed.  Woke up at 8AM...clear as a F&C*ing bell again!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||8
